{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf6hMwouMALcztpU9F2iW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` shows BUILD SUCCESS with 23 tests passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All baseline tests in OrderControllerTest, ShipmentControllerTest, CustomerControllerTest pass (0 failures/errors)\n3. ✅ **`POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` cancels active order, persists, cancels CREATED shipments** \n   - OrderControllerTest: `testCancelActiveOrderSucceeds` (verifies ACTIVE→CANCELLED transition and 200 response)\n   - OrderControllerTest: `testCancellingAnOrderCancelsAllCreatedShipments` (verifies shipment status update)\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent with API**\n   - Uses existing exception hierarchy (ConflictException→409, ResourceNotFoundException→404)\n   - GlobalExceptionHandler converts to ApiError envelope (code, message, fields)\n   - Tests validate `$.error.code` and `$.error.message`\n5. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds; CONFIRMED shipment blocks cancel; unknown order refused; shipment creation for cancelled order refused**\n   - OrderControllerTest: `testCancellingAnAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceedsAndReturns200` (idempotency)\n   - OrderControllerTest: `testCancellingAnOrderWithConfirmedShipmentReturns409AndChangesNothing` (unchanged state validation)\n   - OrderControllerTest: `testCancellingANonExistentOrderReturns404` (404 response)\n   - ShipmentControllerTest: `testRejectsCreatingAShipmentForACancelledOrder` (409 response with ORDER_CANCELLED code)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only Kotlin code changes, no pom.xml modifications\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified files needed for feature:\n   - Order.kt (added OrderStatus enum and status field to Order)\n   - OrderController.kt (added cancel endpoint and shipment repository dependency)\n   - ShipmentController.kt (added order repository dependency for cancellation check)\n   - ShipmentRepository.kt (added findByOrderId method)\n   - ApiError.kt (added two new error codes: ORDER_CANCELLED, ORDER_ACTIVE_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Changes | Necessary |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| Order.kt | Added OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and status field (default ACTIVE) | ✅ Yes — core requirement |\n| OrderController.kt | Added shipmentRepository dependency, POST cancel endpoint with logic for idempotency and CONFIRMED check | ✅ Yes — endpoint is the main requirement |\n| ShipmentRepository.kt | Added findByOrderId(orderId) to query shipments by order | ✅ Yes — needed to check shipment statuses during cancel |\n| ShipmentController.kt | Added orderRepository dependency and check to reject shipment creation for CANCELLED orders | ✅ Yes — requirement: \"Creating a shipment for a cancelled order is rejected with HTTP 409\" |\n| ApiError.kt | Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_ACTIVE_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes | ✅ Yes — needed for error responses |\n| OrderControllerTest.kt | Added 8 new tests covering cancel endpoint scenarios | ✅ Yes — required acceptance criteria tests |\n| ShipmentControllerTest.kt | Added 2 new tests covering shipment creation for cancelled order | ✅ Yes — tests requirement about shipment rejection |\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All acceptance criteria are met:\n- ✅ New order status field properly defaults to ACTIVE and persists\n- ✅ Cancel endpoint correctly transitions ACTIVE→CANCELLED\n- ✅ Cancelled shipments (CREATED status only) are updated\n- ✅ Idempotent: repeated cancel of CANCELLED order succeeds\n- ✅ Atomic validation: CONFIRMED shipment blocks cancel, nothing changes\n- ✅ 404 for non-existent order\n- ✅ 409 for shipment creation on CANCELLED order\n- ✅ All tests pass; no regression\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement:** Add `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` endpoint with order status tracking (ACTIVE/CANCELLED), idempotent cancellation, atomic validation for CONFIRMED shipments, and prevention of creating shipments for cancelled orders.\n\n**Changed:**\n- Order.kt: Added OrderStatus enum and status field (default ACTIVE) to Order data class\n- OrderController.kt: Added POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with idempotency, CONFIRMED shipment check, and cascading shipment cancellation\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId method to retrieve all shipments for an order\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added order cancellation check before allowing shipment creation\n- ApiError.kt: Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_ACTIVE_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 8 tests for cancel endpoint (success, idempotency, CONFIRMED conflict, 404, cascading shipment cancellation, multiple shipments)\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 2 tests (non-existent order allowed, cancelled order rejected)\n\n**Tests:**\n- testNewlyCreatedOrderHasActiveStatus: Verifies orders default to ACTIVE status\n- testCancelsAnActiveOrderAndReturns200WithCancelledStatus: Main success path\n- testCancellingAnAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceedsAndReturns200: Idempotency\n- testCancellingANonExistentOrderReturns404: 404 response with error envelope\n- testCancellingAnOrderCancelsAllCreatedShipments: Cascading shipment status update\n- testCancellingAnOrderWithConfirmedShipmentReturns409AndChangesNothing: Atomic conflict validation\n- testCreatingAShipmentForACancelledOrderReturns409: Shipment creation prevention\n- testCancellingAnOrderWithMultipleShipmentsCancelsOnlyCreatedOnes: Mixed shipment statuses\n- testCanCreateAShipmentForAnOrderThatDoesNotExist: Baseline preserved\n- testRejectsCreatingAShipmentForACancelledOrder: Explicit shipment rejection test\n\n**Verification:** Command `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory returned BUILD SUCCESS with 23 tests passing (12 OrderControllerTest, 7 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests), 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All requirements implemented and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":37029,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":893},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fbe0d1b-83e5-4b93-9394-c97899d21215","uuid":"996b709f-b775-4cef-89bf-7f20963eed0a","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:08:03.283Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6hMwNbwaEghmD3JT17z"}
